{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1531294-analogues-and-inspirations","id":1531294,"title":"Analogues and Inspirations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-22T09:23:41-08:00","id":1531294,"title":"Analogues and Inspirations","content":"So I have a habit of trying to match existing characters from across fiction to categories in other things, and Exalted is no exception. I\u2019ve been trying to dig up characters who map to the different Exalt types and castes.<br /> <br /> Here\u2019s <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U7nD0o59UUIkuO9y5ob3qILatiuGuI-6QYEjk7xdDmo/edit\" target=\"_blank\">the list.</a> Any choices you like? Any you disagree with or find confusing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Teller of Tales, and the Weaver of Dreams<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14qUE6JyfwtXyd8SMY5gSJ_vvUZPCvGDZiIbBk19QPiU/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Behold! My 2e characters.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13327-voyd211","name":"Voyd211","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13327_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"221"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-22T18:30:16-08:00","id":1531327,"title":"","content":"I think to comment meaningfully on the connections you're drawing, I'd have to know why you're drawing them and from what part of the character to what part of the type/aspect.<br /> For example, you list Link as a Dawn. And he does sword a lot, is chosen-oney, etc. But that's in the context of a plausibly larger focus on exploration and tool use in those games - did that make him more Dawny to you, is that to you an expression of Dawn or Solar themes? Things like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25764-vwllss-trnt-prncss","name":"vwllss trnt prncss","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"244"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-24T16:01:20-08:00","id":1531442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vwllss trnt prncss</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1531294-analogues-and-inspirations?p=1531327#post1531327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think to comment meaningfully on the connections you're drawing, I'd have to know why you're drawing them and from what part of the character to what part of the type/aspect.<br /> For example, you list Link as a Dawn. And he does sword a lot, is chosen-oney, etc. But that's in the context of a plausibly larger focus on exploration and tool use in those games - did that make him more Dawny to you, is that to you an expression of Dawn or Solar themes? Things like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s because Link is, above all else, a warrior. No matter which version of him you're looking at, he has an uncanny talent for picking up any kind of tool and finding a use for it in combat, and he can do so immediately with very little if any training.<br /> <br /> Plus, he is in my mind THE Exalted character who is not actually in Exalted. When I have to explain this setting to my friends, I always use the Triforce as a comparison for the Exaltation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Teller of Tales, and the Weaver of Dreams<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14qUE6JyfwtXyd8SMY5gSJ_vvUZPCvGDZiIbBk19QPiU/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Behold! My 2e characters.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13327-voyd211","name":"Voyd211","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13327_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"221"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}